    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">house of cards</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Catra suddenly laughs, because what is she doing? Sheâ€™s a closeted lesbian who hasnâ€™t spoken to her family in years because of it, sheâ€™s struggling financially through grad school, she lives in a shitty apartment, and sheâ€™s just, essentially, offered to help a ghost figure out how to be a ghost.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;But the hopeful look in Adoraâ€™s eyes is still there, and sheâ€™s wearing the first genuine smile Catraâ€™s ever seen on her, and sheâ€™s almost blindsided by how beautiful Adora is.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;So Catra nods and says, â€œyeah. Iâ€™ll help you figure it out,â€ because really, how hard can it be?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;(Really, she has no idea what sheâ€™s getting herself into.)&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
